---
---
<section class="whyfast-shell">
  <div class="whyfast-wrap">
    <header class="whyfast-head">
      <h2 class="whyfast-title">Why Brands Choose FAST</h2>
      <p class="whyfast-sub">
        Production, creative, and ops aligned so your show runs clean.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="whyfast-cols">
      <!-- LEFT: 3:4 image, dictates column height -->
      <figure class="whyfast-media glass-silver" aria-label="FAST show visual">
        <img
          src="https://i.imgur.com/oDH5EMW.jpeg"
          alt="FAST road visual"
          width="600" height="800"              <!-- preserves 3:4 intrinsic ratio -->
          loading="lazy" decoding="async"
          fetchpriority="low"
          style="object-fit:cover; width:100%; height:100%; border-radius:inherit;"
          onerror="this.style.background='#1a1a1a'; this.alt='Image unavailable';"
        />
      </figure>

      <!-- RIGHT: 2 x 3 grid that stretches to match figure height -->
      <div class="whyfast-grid">
        <article class="whyfast-card glass-silver hover-magenta">
          <div class="card-icon">✎</div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Creative Agility</h3>
          <p class="card-copy">Ideas fast, on brand, ready to build and approve.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="whyfast-card glass-silver hover-magenta">
          <div class="card-icon">▦</div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Technical Precision</h3>
          <p class="card-copy">CAD, load, power, and rigging sorted before you hit site.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="whyfast-card glass-silver hover-magenta">
          <div class="card-icon">◷</div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Last-Minute Rescue</h3>
          <p class="card-copy">Late brief, new VIP, weather shift. We turn it around today.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="whyfast-card glass-silver hover-magenta">
          <div class="card-icon">▣</div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Live Ops Control</h3>
          <p class="card-copy">Showcaller, comms, and run-of-show locked to the minute.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="whyfast-card glass-silver hover-magenta">
          <div class="card-icon">⌗</div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Modular and Scalable</h3>
          <p class="card-copy">Kits for malls, roadshows, expos, and tours.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="whyfast-card glass-silver hover-magenta">
          <div class="card-icon">🛡</div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Safe and Compliant</h3>
          <p class="card-copy">Permits, HSE, risk, and crew briefed and audited.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
